// # Fleet Tick Anchor - Read-Only Mechanical Tick Pages (RFC 0013)
//
// Logline: Re-exports the read-only state sweep, quota meter, and agent pages of the RFC 0013 fleet tick.
//
// Setup: Shim page. sweep.oo, meter.oo and agents.oo are the slices; test_sweep.oo is the driver and stays outside the anchor so a main symbol never leaks into importers.
//
// Beats:
//   1. sweep.oo — repository enumeration plus LOCKED/DIRTY/CLEAN/ERR report.
//   2. btext.oo — byte-native text primitives (str_index_of is byte-indexed, str_slice is char-indexed).
//   3. meter.oo — agent usage parsing plus QUOTA verdict lines.
//   4. agents.oo — herdr agent list parsing plus the idle-workspace report.

import "fleettick/btext.oo";
import "fleettick/sweep.oo";
import "fleettick/meter.oo";
import "fleettick/agents.oo";
